utsādyante jāti-dharmāḥ
kula-dharmāś ca śāśvatāḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":406,\"bb\":369,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/42/b369/\",\"shadow_value\":\"doṣaiḥ – by such faults; etaiḥ – all these; kula-ghnānām – of the destroyers of the family; varṇa-saṅkara – of unwanted children; kārakaiḥ – which are causes; utsādyante – are devastated; jāti-dharmāḥ – community projects; kula-dharmāḥ – family traditions; ca – also; śāśvatāḥ – eternal.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"doṣaiḥ\",\"translation\":\"by such faults\"},{\"word\":\"etaiḥ\",\"translation\":\"all these\"},{\"word\":\"kula-ghnānām\",\"translation\":\"of the destroyers of the family\"},{\"word\":\"varṇa-saṅkara\",\"translation\":\"of unwanted children\"},{\"word\":\"kārakaiḥ\",\"translation\":\"which are causes\"},{\"word\":\"utsādyante\",\"translation\":\"are devastated\"},{\"word\":\"jāti-dharmāḥ\",\"translation\":\"community projects\"},{\"word\":\"kula-dharmāḥ\",\"translation\":\"family traditions\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"śāśvatāḥ\",\"translation\":\"eternal\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":407,\"bb\":370,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/42/b370/\",\"body_value\":\"By the evil deeds of those who destroy the family tradition and thus give rise to unwanted children, all kinds of community projects and family welfare activities are devastated.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":408,\"bb\":371,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/42/b371/\",\"body_value\":\"Community projects for the four orders of human society, combined with family welfare activities, as they are set forth by the institution of sanātana-dharma, or varṇāśrama-dharma, are designed to enable the human being to attain his ultimate salvation. Therefore, the breaking of the sanātana-dharma tradition by irresponsible leaders of society brings about chaos in that society, and consequently people forget the aim of life – Viṣṇu. Such leaders are called blind, and persons who follow such leaders are sure to be led into chaos.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 1.42\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 1.42\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/bg/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/bg/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is\"}],\" » \"]}]